# Packaged extension builds. `vsce package` writes a 16 MB VSIX into the
# repository root, and nothing here should ever carry one: it is output, it is
# regenerated by `npm run build && vsce package`, and three of them sitting
# untracked put fifty megabytes one `git add -A` away from the history.
*.vsix
